cloud-architecture-diagram

direction right
typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel

Global Entry [color: blue] {
  DNS [label: "Route 53"]
  CloudFront [icon: aws-cloudfront]
}

Primary Mumbai [color: green] {
  PrimaryApp [icon: aws-fargate, label: "ECS/Fargate • ap-south-1"]
  PrimaryDB [icon: aws-rds, label: "RDS PostgreSQL Multi-AZ"]
  PrimaryS3 [icon: aws-simple-storage-service, label: "S3"]
  PrimaryECR [label: "ECR"]
  PrimarySecrets [label: "Secrets Manager"]
}

DR Hyderabad [color: orange] {
  DRNetwork [label: "Pre-provisioned VPC / ALB / IAM"]
  DRApp [icon: aws-fargate, label: "ECS Services\nscaled minimal until failover"]
  DRDB [icon: aws-rds, label: "Cross-Region Read Replica"]
  DRS3 [icon: aws-simple-storage-service, label: "S3 Replica / Recovery Copy"]
  DRECR [label: "ECR Replica"]
  DRSecrets [label: "Secrets Replica"]
}

Recovery Control [color: red] {
  Runbook [label: "Automated DR Runbook"]
  Health [label: "Health + Replication Checks"]
  Decision [label: "Human-authorized Regional Failover"]
}

DNS > CloudFront
CloudFront > PrimaryApp: Normal traffic
PrimaryApp > PrimaryDB
PrimaryApp > PrimaryS3

PrimaryDB > DRDB: Async cross-Region replication
PrimaryS3 > DRS3: Replication / backup copy
PrimaryECR > DRECR: Image replication
PrimarySecrets > DRSecrets: Secret replication

Health > PrimaryApp, PrimaryDB, DRDB
Health > Decision
Decision > Runbook: Declare Regional disaster
Runbook > DRDB: Promote replica
Runbook > DRApp: Scale services
DRECR > DRApp: Pull known-good images
DRSecrets > DRApp: Regional secrets
DRApp > DRDB
DRApp > DRS3
Runbook > CloudFront: Switch healthy origin / routing

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [color: green, label: "Primary Region"]
  [color: orange, label: "DR Region"]
  [color: red, label: "Recovery control"]
}
